  "id": "autonomic-dysfunction",
  "term": "autonomic dysfunction",
  "definition": "Autonomic dysfunction is impaired functioning of the autonomic nervous system, the body system that helps maintain internal balance and regulates cardiovascular activity. In this source, it refers to problems in that control that can occur when cancer treatments affect autonomic and cardiovascular function.",
